{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34451","headline":"南阳广文博士还雷平後寄 · 陆龟蒙","name":"南阳广文博士还雷平後寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微微春色染林塘，亲拨烟霞坐涧房。\n阴洞雪胶知未入，浊醪风破的偷尝。\n芝台晓用金铛煮，星度闲将玉铪量。\n几遍侍晨官欲降，曙坛先起独焚香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34451.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34451","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}